config BR2_PACKAGE_ROBOTICS_MIDDLEWARE
	bool "robotics-middleware"
	help
	  Robotics Middleware Abstraction for Engineering Workbench
	  
	  Provides modular, hypergraph-encoded workbench components for
	  robotics middleware with tensor-based device abstraction and
	  GGUF integration support.
	  
	  Features:
	  - Device/sensor/actuator tensor abstractions
	  - Hypergraph-encoded middleware components
	  - GGUF serialization for agent states
	  - Neural-symbolic middleware interfaces
	  - Real-time tensor field visualization
	  
	  https://github.com/HyperCogWizard/ml-operating-system